packages/*/t/
.copilot-*
.*-eval.log

# CI sccache local-disk backend (restored/saved by actions/cache in test-rust).
.sccache/

# Broker feature-pass target dirs are execution-only Cargo target-dir
# exceptions under the repository-root target/; they are not workspace
# authority or independent lockfile roots.
target/broker-layer1/
target/broker-fakebackends/

# Scratch space for throwaway probes: one-off crates, parser experiments,
# and any file written to reason about behaviour rather than to ship it.
# Put debugging artifacts here rather than beside the code they probe, so a
# catch-all `git add` cannot sweep them into a commit. Two have already
# reached the tree this way: a stray src/bin probe that broke the build, and
# a 21 MB crate complete with its target directory.
.scratch/
.worktrees/
__pycache__/

# Runtime metadata for standalone d2b-gascity orchestration. Host distribution
# and installation belong to gascity.nix; d2b never migrates or sweeps host
# state below /var/lib/gascity* or /run/gascity*.
.gc/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init). Live Gas City issue state belongs
# to the standalone city and a dedicated rig clone, not this product tree.
.dolt/
*.db
.beads/
.beads-credential-key
